  "open_questions": [
    "SpeedoRoutes numbering does not follow PMA's: of our 23 held routes, only RT-04, RT-05 and RT-11 have the same terminals; 9 differ partly and 11 are entirely different (see termini_match_ours in lahore-speedo-timings.json). Its route list matches a 2019 terminal-pair list (daniyalaslam63/lahore-bus-routes), so it may reflect older routes.",
    "RT-22 is a copy of the page's Route #21, and Route #16 copies Route #01.",
    "Stop sequences such as #23, #28 and #30 are geographically implausible, and 'Total Stops' often disagrees with the list length.",
    "No coordinates in the source."
